    "detailed_description": "<strong>Basement of Hellish</strong> is a survival horror game with zombies in 1st person. Survive and struggle to find a way out in this horror game with tense and dark atmosphere.<br><br>Explore and manage your resources. <strong>Basement of Hellish</strong> is a game where every bullet matters.<br><br>Escape and find a way to survive in a basement infested with zombies and a powerful enemy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>  <strong>Dark atmosphere</strong><br>Tense enviroment. The game takes place in a basement with dark atmosphere and contains elements of blood and gore.<br><br></li><li>  <strong>Survival Horror</strong><br>Lot of zombies that can quickly surround and overwhelm you. Some are stronger than others.<br><br></li><li>  <strong>Limited Resources</strong><br>Use your resources wisely, after all, spending a bullet wrong can cause your death.<br><br></li><li>  <strong>Explore and find a way out</strong><br>Look for items that will help your survival, fight and find a way to escape of this basement.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Tense Atmosphere<br></li><li>Dark and tight places<br></li><li>Gore<br></li><li>FPS with fast combat<br></li><li>Some items are random to improve replayability<br></li><li>Limited ammo and batteries<br></li><li>Lot of zombies<br></li><li>A strong and tough enemy<br></li><li>2 playable difficulties<br></li><li>2 playable maps</li></ul>",
